blurb = "Depicts a small spring nestled in a narrow gorge surrounded by lush hills in Kanazawa, an area of the Musashi province, present-day Kanagawa prefecture.

Note that this is not the more famous modern city of Kanazawa, the capital of Ishikawa prefecture.

The inscription at the top appears to be a Chinese poem that I was unable to reliably translate or attribute."
